{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281140","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281140","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1028114001:1":{"text":"Could it be that the hornleaf bear from your memory is the same one we buried earlier...?! ","source_cn":"难道说，刚才回忆里那只叶角熊，是我们之前埋葬的那只叶角...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAD714CAE728E7B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028114002:0":{"text":"Yes... Softpaw was my first friend. ","source_cn":"……是的。它……伊尔贡，是我的第一个朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33146AE71948BF56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028114003:0":{"text":"He was very gentle, fluffy, and honest, but also very brave. His favorite food was honey. He trusted me...","source_cn":"它很温柔，毛绒绒的，有一点点憨厚，可是很勇敢，最喜欢吃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A5C2BC7F5B8C4FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028114004:0":{"text":"But this time, I couldn't heal him... I... ","source_cn":"可这次，我没能来得及治好它……我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67CFB6FCD9C6CB19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1028114004":{"text":"But this time, I couldn't heal him... I... ","source_cn":"可这次，我没能来得及治好它……我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67CFB6FCD9C6CB19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028114007:1":{"text":"Hewynn, you'll always have this memory of him. ","source_cn":"伊温小姐，它永远都会在你的记忆里陪着你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31B73E3AF0C6A060","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028114008:1":{"text":"If you feel a sudden sweetness in your heart one day, it's probably him trying to give you honey! ","source_cn":"要是你哪天突然感到心头一甜，没准就是它在请你吃蜂蜜呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC125D2E74BBF5AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028114009:0":{"text":"Thank you all for your kind words. My grief will disappear one day, but not today...","source_cn":"谢谢你们的安慰，我会慢慢走出悲伤的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F706ABC26839092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028114010:0":{"text":"I'm starting to feel my power return. Hopefully, I can recover the last of my lost magic without any issues. ","source_cn":"我的力量也开始恢复了，希望能顺利回收最后一处散逸的魔力……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB4B227EA3F4A9CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028114011:0":{"text":"Hewynn, what kind of item do we need for your next memory? ","source_cn":"伊温小姐，这次需要什么样的物品来激活记忆碎片呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9506BC13DC1A53B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028114012:1":{"text":"A bellflower... I know where to find it. ","source_cn":"嗯，我想，需要一朵铃兰……我知道该去哪里找它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x448FBA5048A1E965","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"(Stay silent)","source_cn":"（不说话，默默陪伴）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD7A8F81517A23A18","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(Stay silent)","female":"(Stay silent)","variant_male_record_index":"61196","variant_female_record_index":"61197","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028114005:0":{"text":"Softpaw, I miss you...","source_cn":"伊尔贡，我很想你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19CFAEACA9D55A86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028114006:0":{"text":"Don't worry. I can control my emotions. ","source_cn":"别担心，我会努力调整好情绪的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5B0AFDD3184E350","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"Your magic 